  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\n仕事中かっていうと、電話に限らずそうだけど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011030020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふっ、確かに！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701103/2007011030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011030030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──でもその割に、不真面目じゃありませんでした？\r\nなぁに、さっきのピースは",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_bad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_bad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701103/2007011030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おおっ、そうだそうだ\r\n──アンティーカ、新しく歌番組への出演が決まりました！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
