      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それもあれだぞ！\r\n一日ぶっ通しで音楽づけのやつだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アンティーカの曲だけじゃなくて、\r\n大御所とコラボで披露する曲もいくつか頼まれてる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんなはすごいよ！\r\n俺嬉しくて──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011030040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200701103/2007011030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、急にピースされても困るよな……！\r\n悪かった、ははは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011030050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……ふふ\r\nまぁ、『どうした！？』とは思ったけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701103/2007011030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011030060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰も改めて嬉しくなっちゃったよね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701103/2007011030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011030070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーってばほんとに、一秒でも空き時間が\r\nあったら三峰たちのこと考えてくれてるんだなって",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701103/2007011030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、いまさらだろ\r\nそれが俺の仕事だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007011030080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふはっ、キメ顔だ～～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701103/2007011030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これに関しては誇りを持って言えるからな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──それから、もうひとつ\r\n俺の大事な仕事",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
